{"seq":13,"slug":"finops-cloud-cost-optimization","title":"FinOps 与云成本优化","stage":"DONE","category":"cloud-infrastructure","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization","rating":{"composite":3.78,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.8,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":3.5,"strategic":4},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"introMarkdown":"# FinOps 与云成本优化 简介\n\n云的魅力在于\"按需取用、即开即用\"，但这份弹性也悄悄改变了花钱的方式：过去采购硬件要走漫长的审批，如今一个工程师敲几行配置就能拉起一片集群，账单则在月底姗姗来迟。结果是，云支出常常成为一笔说不清、管不住、又居高不下的开销——没人确切知道每一分钱花在了哪里，也没人对它真正负责。FinOps 正是为回应这一困境而生：它不是简单的省钱，而是一套把云财务管理与工程实践融为一体的文化与方法，让工程、财务、业务三方在同一套数据上协作，把云支出变成一项可度量、可问责、可持续优化的工程能力。\n\n本知识库面向工程师与平台团队，不预设深厚的财务背景，循着\"理念—看清—优化—治理\"的脉络，系统讲解如何把不受控的云账单转化为有据可依的工程决策。\n\n第一章**FinOps 基础与原则**确立全局视角：FinOps 究竟在解决什么问题，它所倡导的核心原则（团队协作、人人为成本负责、及时的数据驱动决策），以及\"告知—优化—运营\"这一不断循环的运作模型，为后续实践奠定共同语言。\n\n第二章**成本可见性与度量**回答\"钱花在哪\"这一前提性问题：如何通过标签、分摊与归集，把混沌的账单还原到团队、产品与服务的颗粒度，建立单位经济性等关键指标，让成本第一次变得可见、可比、可追踪。\n\n第三章**成本优化技术**进入\"如何花得更值\"的实操层面：从预留实例与节省计划、自动伸缩与资源规整，到存储分层、闲置回收与架构层面的取舍，系统梳理在不牺牲性能与可靠性的前提下削减浪费的具体手段。\n\n第四章**优化前沿与治理**着眼于让成本意识长久扎根：预算与异常告警、成本左移到设计与 CI 阶段、可持续性与碳成本的新视角，以及把优化从一次性运动沉淀为组织治理机制，让节约成为日常而非救火。\n\n读完本知识库，你将建立起一套贯穿可见性、优化与治理的完整思路，懂得如何让每一分云支出都对得起它创造的价值，并把成本意识真正内化进团队的工程文化之中。\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"finops-foundations","title":"FinOps 基础与原则","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/finops-foundations","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"finops-principles-and-lifecycle","title":"FinOps 原则与生命周期","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/finops-foundations/finops-principles-and-lifecycle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"cloud-billing-models","title":"云计费模型","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/finops-foundations/cloud-billing-models"},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-allocation-and-tagging","title":"成本分摊与标签治理","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/finops-foundations/cost-allocation-and-tagging"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"cost-visibility-and-metrics","title":"成本可见性与度量","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-visibility-and-metrics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"showback-and-chargeback","title":"showback 与 chargeback","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-visibility-and-metrics/showback-and-chargeback"},{"seq":2,"slug":"unit-economics-and-cost-per-x","title":"单位经济与单位成本：让账单对齐业务价值","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-visibility-and-metrics/unit-economics-and-cost-per-x"},{"seq":3,"slug":"anomaly-detection-and-budgets","title":"成本异常检测与预算告警","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-visibility-and-metrics/anomaly-detection-and-budgets"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"cost-optimization-techniques","title":"成本优化技术","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-optimization-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"rightsizing-and-autoscaling","title":"规格优化与弹性伸缩","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-optimization-techniques/rightsizing-and-autoscaling"},{"seq":2,"slug":"commitment-discounts","title":"承诺折扣与预留实例","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-optimization-techniques/commitment-discounts"},{"seq":3,"slug":"spot-and-workload-scheduling","title":"Spot 实例与负载调度","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/cost-optimization-techniques/spot-and-workload-scheduling"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"optimization-frontiers-and-governance","title":"优化前沿与治理","docCount":3,"url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"kubernetes-cost-optimization","title":"Kubernetes 成本优化","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance/kubernetes-cost-optimization"},{"seq":2,"slug":"storage-and-data-transfer-cost","title":"存储与数据传输成本","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance/storage-and-data-transfer-cost"},{"seq":3,"slug":"finops-culture-and-automation","title":"FinOps 文化与自动化","url":"/h/cloud-infrastructure/finops-cloud-cost-optimization/optimization-frontiers-and-governance/finops-culture-and-automation"}]}]}